  "notes": "{金|きん} primarily means gold but also abbreviates Friday.\n\nAS METAL:\n- {金|きん}メダル (gold medal)\n- {純金|じゅんきん} (pure gold)\n- {金|きん}{色|いろ} (gold color)\n- {金|きん}{貨|か} (gold coin)\n\nAS DAY:\n- {金|きん} = {金曜日|きんようび} (Friday)\n\nMETAL COMPARISON:\n- {金|きん} (gold)\n- {銀|ぎん} (silver)\n- {銅|どう} (copper/bronze)\n\nDIFFERENT READING:\n- {金|かね} = money (same kanji, different reading)",
